{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LexiLoong is a turn-based tabletop card simulation game that blends entertainment with education. Each card is uniquely named after the initial letter and length of an English word, such as &quot;A5&quot; for the word &quot;Apple.&quot; The core gameplay revolves around matching either the letter or number from the previous card played. Building on this foundation, LexiLoong offers the following distinctive features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>Special Cards</strong>: Includes magic cards, penalty cards, wild cards, and dragon cards to diversify gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>Spelling Challenge Cards</strong>: Seamlessly integrates educational elements into the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>Voice-Activated Play (Requires Microphone)\u200b</strong>: Players trigger card plays by reading the word aloud and earn in-game coins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u200b<strong>Scenario-Based Level Design</strong>: Stages are categorized by real-world English word usage contexts.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758650?t=1751611128","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3758650?t=1751611128","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758650/5367d2438e29c3463e92f909fc8a79598a4a0887/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751611128","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758650/5367d2438e29c3463e92f909fc8a79598a4a0887/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751611128","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"S